Category definitions

DATA_SOURCE_ISSUE: The source value is missing, clearly incorrect, or the calculated value cannot be produced from the available data.
VERSION_DIFFERENCE: The calculated and source values differ by more than the configured threshold but not enough to indicate a major formula or denominator difference.
FORMULA_DISCREPANCY: The difference is large enough to suggest materially different calculation definitions or denominator treatment.
NO_ANOMALY: The calculated and source values are within the configured threshold.

ANALYTICS RULE

The ratio engine calculation is used for analytics. The companies.xlsx value is used only as a source comparison reference.

DATA QUALITY RULE

Balance-sheet integrity checks are audit-only. The script does not modify financial records.
